#: includes/settings/views/documentation/feature-certificates.php
msgid "The layout box of the form editor sets a background image and a background colour; the colour fills the page wherever the image does not cover it. Preview renders the unsaved layout on the server with sample data, through the same renderer as the PDF, so the background, the colour and the QR code are the ones the certificate prints. Save as model keeps the layout, the image and the colour, and loading the model brings all three back."
